User debian-tor
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor

RunAsDaemon 0
Log notice stdout

SocksPort 0

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/main
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServiceExportCircuitID haproxy

# Proxy
HiddenServicePort 22  [::1]:9022
HiddenServicePort 25  [::1]:9025
HiddenServicePort 80  [::1]:9080
HiddenServicePort 143 [::1]:9143
HiddenServicePort 587 [::1]:9587
